        "entry_type": "decision",
        "text": "Single-pass hashing: When performing prefix verification during incremental copying, bytes `0` to `state.ByteOffset` are hashed; if the prefix matches, subsequent appended bytes are piped through the same hasher via `io.TeeReader`, computing the complete new prefix hash in a single pass without re-reading the entire file."
